      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Frequent ranging interval. UWB - 96 milliseconds for config id UwbRangingParams.CONFIG_PROVISIONED_UNICAST_DS_TWR_VERY_FAST, 120 milliseconds otherwise. See UwbRangingCapabilities.getSupportedRangingUpdateRates() to verify Frequent update rate is supported; BLE RSSI - 500 milliseconds; BLE CS - 100 milliseconds; WiFi Rtt - 128 milliseconds if RttRangingCapabilities.hasPeriodicRangingHardwareFeature() is true, 256 milliseconds otherwise; WiFi PD - 128 milliseconds.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/ranging/raw/RawRangingDevice#UPDATE_RATE_FREQUENT" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.ranging.raw.RawRangingDevice.UPDATE_RATE_FREQUENT</code>.</a></format></para>
