        <summary>
          <para>Normal ranging interval (Default). UWB - 200 milliseconds for config ids UwbRangingParams.getConfigId() with multicast ranging, 240 milliseconds for unicast; BLE RSSI - 1 second; BLE CS - 200 ms; WiFi Rtt - 256 milliseconds if RttRangingCapabilities.hasPeriodicRangingHardwareFeature() is true, 512 milliseconds otherwise; WiFi PD - 256 milliseconds.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/ranging/raw/RawRangingDevice#UPDATE_RATE_NORMAL" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.ranging.raw.RawRangingDevice.UPDATE_RATE_NORMAL</code>.</a></format></para>
